}
```

## 5.0 Vulnerability Context
**Pattern:** 1.12 — Mass assignment via object fields (BOLA)

The Apex controller `c.OpportunityController.getOpportunity` accepts a `opportunityId` parameter from the client-side
Aura component. The controller runs `without sharing` and does not validate that the
authenticated user owns or has been granted access to the requested record.

An attacker with a valid Salesforce session can substitute any `opportunityId` value in the
Aura framework request payload to access records owned by other users.

