### 7.2 The Actual Excessive Payload (What the Attacker Sees)
Because the attacker is not using the official frontend app, they intercept the raw HTTP response containing the full database row.

**Endpoint:** `GET /api/v3/subscribers/89103000000012345678/diagnostics`
**Actual HTTP Response Body:**
