# SYNTHETIC ARTIFACT: FAIL-OPEN & AUDIT LOG BYPASS (HAR TRACE)
**Applies to Architecture:** FirstResponse CAD Integration API v4.0.1
**Vulnerabilities Referenced:** Section 4.1 (Pattern 8.2 & Pattern 7.3)

This HTTP Archive (HAR) trace captures the moment the attacker successfully exploits the availability-over-security design decision. The attacker submits a `POST` request to create a CRITICAL incident *without* a valid `Authorization` header.

